;Description
:This template is used to mark pages for deletion, categorizing them in [[:Category:Candidates for deletion]].
;Syntax
:Type <code>{{t|delete}}</code> on the page to be deleted.'''

Example: 
===For all editors===
<pre>{{delete|reason=<b>Empty Page</b>}}</pre>
{{delete|reason=<b>Empty Page</b>}}
<hr/>
===Only for admins===
<pre>{{delete|reason=<b>Empty Page</b>|deletiondate=2084-11-30}}</pre>
{{delete|reason=<b>Empty Page</b>|deletiondate=2084-11-30}}

